The `?sslmode=require` is getting garbled with a quote character. Strip it from the URL and set SSL mode separately:

```bash
PGURL=$(echo $DATABASE_URL | sed 's/?sslmode=require//')
PGSSLMODE=require psql "$PGURL" -c "\dn"
```

```bash
PGSSLMODE=require psql "$PGURL" -c "\dt *.*"
```

```bash
PGSSLMODE=require psql "$PGURL" -c "SELECT * FROM sra.v_queue_kpis;"
```

```bash
PGSSLMODE=require psql "$PGURL" -c "\dt src.*"
```
